# Reusable switches (crm_mobile)

Do **not** use Flutter's raw `Switch`, `Switch.adaptive`, or `SwitchListTile`.

They blend into dark navy cards in dark mode. Always use:

- `AppSwitch` — standalone toggle (e.g. settings row trailing)
- `AppSwitchListTile` — labeled toggle row in forms/modals

Import: `package:crm_mobile/widgets/app_switch.dart` (or a relative path to `lib/widgets/app_switch.dart`).

```dart
// ❌ BAD
Switch.adaptive(value: enabled, onChanged: onChanged)
SwitchListTile(title: Text('Active'), value: enabled, onChanged: onChanged)

// ✅ GOOD
AppSwitch(value: enabled, onChanged: onChanged)
AppSwitchListTile(title: Text('Active'), value: enabled, onChanged: onChanged)
```

Theme colors live in `AppTheme.switchThemeFor` — do not invent one-off switch colors.
